      "id": "CC-03-wrong-child-sibling",
      "category": "wrong-child",
      "description": "A capture logged under the wrong sibling is retargeted conversationally. The raw transcript still says \"Leo\" — raw is preserved even though the structured record moves.",
      "exercises": ["child retarget with lineage", "raw transcript keeps the original name", "no duplicate entry per child", "retarget authorization within grants"],
      "setup": {
        "turns": [
          {
